uto. Per un attimo resta sconvolta. Poi se ne va, appoggiandosi alla stampella che sorregge la sua gamba malandata."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Woman Next Door","overview":"Two ex-lovers wind up living next door to each other with their respective spouses. Forbidden passions ensue.","tagline":"A destructive passion between desire and madness."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Ayant autrefois vécu des amours ombrageuses, Bernard et Mathilde, par le plus pur des hasards, se trouvent être voisins. Même s'ils sont mariés tous deux, leurs destins se croisent à nouveau.","tagline":"Une passion destructrice, entre désir et folie."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7u2op0VKvexDj5wxi5Jq4RCqR9F.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/OUsYvkuqmGuE63IE5a2QQqW426.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":12579,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7u2op0VKvexDj5wxi5Jq4RCqR9F.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7u2op0VKvexDj5wxi5Jq4RCqR9F.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7u2op0VKvexDj5wxi5Jq4RCqR9F.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7u2op0VKvexDj5wxi5Jq4RCqR9F.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yNtlg1kyI0KRGRrB5WhnjglBQDo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yNtlg1kyI0KRGRrB5WhnjglBQDo.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nJvWSMwQrB3XcgtZVCGCEIYB7P2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nJvWSMwQrB3XcgtZVCGCEIYB7P2.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h9p6z1NTexeLLqrDVI7